          {
            "title": "Question: Curly braces",
            "id": 89497,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale di queste due variabili memorizza un set?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"team_1 = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alice&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ted&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sam&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"team_2 = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alice&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ted&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sam&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>team_2</code> perché i valori sono racchiusi tra parentesi graffe</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>team_1</code> perché i valori sono racchiusi tra parentesi quadre</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Non possiamo dirlo perché entrambe le variabili memorizzano valori univoci</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>team_2</code> perché i valori sono racchiusi tra parentesi graffe.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Supponi di scrivere due volte <code>\"Alice\"</code> in entrambe le assegnazioni. Quanti valori memorizzerebbero <code>team_1</code> e <code>team_2</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"team_1 = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alice&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ted&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sam&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"team_2 = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alice&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ted&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sam&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">team_1 ha 4 valori; team_2 ne ha 3.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Entrambi hanno 4 valori.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">team_1 ha 3 valori; team_2 ne ha 4.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">team_1 ha 4 valori; team_2 ne ha 3.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Commas",
            "id": 89499,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa c'è che non va in questo codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"frequent_values = {\" /><text value=\"34\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"17.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">I valori dell'insieme devono essere separati da virgole</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Gli insiemi non possono contenere valori float come <code>17.5</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Non c'è nulla di sbagliato nel codice</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">I valori dell'insieme devono essere separati da virgole.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale sostituzione crea il set desiderato senza modificare alcun valore?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"frequent_values = {\" /><text value=\"34\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"17.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>frequent_values = {34, 20, 17, 17.5}</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>frequent_values = [34, 20, 17, 17.5]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>frequent_values = {34 20 17}</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>frequent_values = {34, 20, 17, 17.5}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Save in variable",
            "id": 89505,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa viene visualizzato nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"entrance_codes = {\" /><text value=\"2929\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1101\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1134\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(entrance_codes)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{2929, 1101, 1134}\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">L'insieme <code>{2929, 1101, 1134}</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">La lista <code>[2929, 1101, 1134]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Il nome della variabile <code>entrance_codes</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">L'insieme <code>{2929, 1101, 1134}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se durante la creazione di <code>entrance_codes</code> viene incluso un altro <code>1101</code>, quanti valori distinti memorizza il set?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"entrance_codes = {\" /><text value=\"2929\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1101\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1134\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(entrance_codes)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{2929, 1101, 1134}\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tre, perché un set memorizza <code>1101</code> una sola volta</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Quattro, perché i set conservano i valori duplicati</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Due, perché aggiungere un duplicato rimuove entrambe le copie</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tre, perché un set memorizza <code>1101</code> una sola volta.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Intro 2",
            "id": 89509,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifica un altro valore in modo che la variabile <code>invited</code> memorizzi un set valido.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"invited = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;May&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Diya&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Erik&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;May&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Diya&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"Erik\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi <code>\"Erik\"</code> come terzo invitato, così <code>invited</code> contiene tre nomi diversi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"invited = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;May&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Diya&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Erik&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;May&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Diya&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"Erik\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Curly braces",
            "id": 89511,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi un set contenente i valori <code>\"ann99\"</code>, seguito da <code>\"jess05\"</code>, separati da una virgola.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;ann99&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;jess05&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"27\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'ann99', 'jess05'}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>{\"ann99\", \"jess05\"}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Avoid errors",
            "id": 89855,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa viene visualizzato nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"iris_species = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;setosa&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;siberian&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;aphylla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"iris_species.remove(\" /><text value=\"&quot;pumila&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(iris_species)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"KeyError: 'pumila'\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Un errore perché <code>\"pumila\"</code> non è presente nell'insieme</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>{'setosa', 'siberian', aphylla'}</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Niente</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Un errore perché <code>\"pumila\"</code> non è presente nell'insieme.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Supponi di sostituire <code>remove(\"pumila\")</code> con <code>remove(\"setosa\")</code>. Che cosa mostrerebbe la stampa finale?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"iris_species = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;setosa&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;siberian&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;aphylla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"iris_species.remove(\" /><text value=\"&quot;pumila&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(iris_species)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"KeyError: 'pumila'\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>{\"siberian\", \"aphylla\"}</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un KeyError, perché remove() genera sempre un errore.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>{\"setosa\"}</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>{\"siberian\", \"aphylla\"}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Add a new element",
            "id": 89834,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa fa questo codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"pine_species = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar pine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pine_species.add(\" /><text value=\"&quot;slash pine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(pine_species)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{'slash pine', 'sugar pine'}\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Aggiunge il valore <code>\"slash pine\"</code> all'insieme <code>pine_species</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Aggiunge il valore <code>\"slash pine\"</code> all'indice <code>0</code> dell'insieme <code>pine_species</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Non fa nulla, perché il codice non è corretto</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Aggiunge il valore <code>\"slash pine\"</code> all'insieme <code>pine_species</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dopo questo codice, <code>pine_species.add(\"sugar pine\")</code> viene eseguito ancora una volta. Quanti valori contiene il set?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"pine_species = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar pine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pine_species.add(\" /><text value=\"&quot;slash pine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(pine_species)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{'slash pine', 'sugar pine'}\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Due, perché aggiungere un valore esistente non crea un duplicato</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tre, perché <code>add()</code> memorizza un'altra copia</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Uno, perché aggiungere un duplicato rimuove il valore più recente</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Due, perché aggiungere un valore esistente non crea un duplicato.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: No duplicates",
            "id": 89833,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quanti valori avrà l'insieme <code>installed</code> dopo aver aggiunto il valore <code>\"Safari\"</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"installed = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;Chrome&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Firefox&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Safari&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"installed.add(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Safari&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(installed)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{'Firefox', 'Safari', 'Chrome'}\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tre valori</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Due valori</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Quattro valori</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tre valori.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Supponi di sostituire <code>add(\"Safari\")</code> con <code>add(\"Edge\")</code>. Quanti valori conterrebbe <code>installed</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"installed = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;Chrome&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Firefox&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Safari&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"installed.add(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Safari&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(installed)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{'Firefox', 'Safari', 'Chrome'}\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Quattro, perché Edge è un nuovo valore.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tre, perché aggiungere un valore a un set non ne modifica mai la dimensione.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Uno, perché add() sostituisce l'intero set.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Quattro, perché Edge è un nuovo valore.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: For loop",
            "id": 89842,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>All'interno del ciclo for, usa una f-string per visualizzare <code>\"Add \"</code> seguita da ciascun ingrediente.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ingredients = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;cacao&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;butter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredient \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Add \" /><text value=\"{ingredient}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ingredients\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Add sugar\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Add butter\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Add cacao\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>Add</code>, seguito da <code>{</code> e poi <code>ingredient</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: No indices",
            "id": 89846,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa c'è che non va in questo codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"reactions = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;upvote&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;downvote&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(reactions[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Gli insiemi non hanno indici, quindi non possiamo accedere agli elementi tramite gli indici come con <code>reactions[0]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non c'è nulla di sbagliato nel codice</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Gli insiemi non hanno un indice <code>0</code>, poiché i loro indici iniziano da <code>1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gli insiemi non hanno indici, quindi non possiamo accedere agli elementi tramite gli indici come con <code>reactions[0]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I set non hanno indici, quindi <code>reactions[0]</code> non può accedere a un valore.</p><p>Quale approccio può visualizzare ogni reazione senza usare un indice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"reactions = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;upvote&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;downvote&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(reactions[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Eseguire un ciclo con <code>for reaction in reactions:</code> e stampare ogni <code>reaction</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Iniziare da <code>reactions[1]</code>, perché gli indici dei set partono da <code>1</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Conservare <code>reactions[0]</code>, perché le parentesi graffe forniscono indici nascosti.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Eseguire un ciclo con <code>for reaction in reactions:</code> e stampare ogni <code>reaction</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Lists and duplicates",
            "id": 89823,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa potremmo usare per memorizzare una raccolta di misurazioni della temperatura che potrebbe contenere valori ripetuti?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Una lista, perché consentirebbe valori di temperatura duplicati</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un set, perché consentirebbe valori di temperatura duplicati</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Una lista o un set, dato che entrambi consentono duplicati</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Una lista, perché consentirebbe valori di temperatura duplicati.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una lista consente temperature duplicate, mentre un set conserva soltanto valori univoci.</p><p>Un sensore registra <code>18</code> due volte ed entrambe le letture vanno conservate. Quale raccolta deve memorizzarle?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Una lista, perché conserva i valori duplicati</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un set, perché conserva ogni lettura duplicata</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Entrambe, perché liste e set gestiscono i duplicati allo stesso modo</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Una lista, perché conserva i valori duplicati.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Eliminate duplicates",
            "id": 89822,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa viene visualizzato nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"iris_species = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;setosa&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;setosa&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;siberian&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(set(iris_species))\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{'setosa', 'siberian'}\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>{'setosa', 'siberian'}</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>{'setosa', 'setosa', 'siberian'}</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>['setosa', 'setosa', 'siberian']</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>{'setosa', 'siberian'}</code>.</p></body></html>",
